    # In demo input, row 0-4 are zeros, row 1 has 5,2 etc., row 9-9 is all 4s, row 10-... are zeros except pattern
    # But in output, the pattern appears starting at row 12 (index 11? row 10 is zeros, row 11 has 5,2 etc. in output)
    # Actually input has pattern at rows 1,3,5,6,7 and then at row 11 (index 10) etc.
    # Output has pattern at rows 1,3,5,6,7 and row 11 (index 10) etc.
    # So we need to copy the pattern below the 4-band once
    # Find the row index of the first 4
    first4 = None
